docs {
  # Get Proposal Counts
  
  ## API Endpoint
  `GET /api/dashboard/counts`
  
  **Auth Required:** ✅ Bearer Token  
  **Roles:** admin, dosen, mahasiswa
  
  ---
  
  ## DTO (Request)
  
  No request body required.
  
  ---
  
  ## Response Structure
  
  ### Success (200 OK)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Berhasil mengambil jumlah proposal",
    "data": {
      "proposal_dalam_proses": 5,
      "proposal_dalam_progress": 3,
      "proposal_telah_selesai": 10,
      "penelitian": 8,
      "pengabdian": 5,
      "kekayaan_intelektual": 5
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Data Description
  
  | Field | Description |
  |-------|-------------|
  | proposal_dalam_proses | Status: Draft |
  | proposal_dalam_progress | Status: Pending |
  | proposal_telah_selesai | Status: Approved |
  | penelitian | Tipe: Penelitian |
  | pengabdian | Tipe: Pengabdian |
  | kekayaan_intelektual | Tipe: HKI |
  
  ---
  
  ## Error Responses
  
  | Status | Message |
  |--------|---------|  
  | 401 | Token tidak valid |
  | 403 | Role tidak diizinkan |
}
